<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Asking for It"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Shinedown"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Threat to Survival"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Threat to Survival (Explicit)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USAT21502572"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="34749848"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="003lkcTC4a4xIj"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="104240070"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="3Tp7y0bLogDQsIO5tTTOH4"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1025208843"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:20.480"><div begin="3.830" end="3:20.480"><p begin="3.830" end="6.000" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.830" end="4.080">Can</span> <span begin="4.080" end="4.280">I</span> <span begin="4.280" end="4.500">have</span> <span begin="4.500" end="4.690">a</span> <span begin="4.690" end="4.910">mo</span><span begin="4.910" end="5.100">ment</span> <span begin="5.100" end="5.300">of</span> <span begin="5.300" end="5.480">your</span> <span begin="5.480" end="5.940">ti</span><span begin="5.940" end="6.000">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能否占用你片刻时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">能否佔用你片刻時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">少しだけ時間をもらえないか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잠깐 네 시간을 좀 내줄래?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu m’accordes un instant de ton temps ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Me concedes un momento de tu tiempo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich einen Moment deiner Zeit haben?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Posso tomar um momento do seu tempo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можешь уделить мне немного своего времени?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Posso rubarti un momento del tuo tempo?</span></p><p begin="6.340" end="8.400" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.340" end="6.570">Just</span> <span begin="6.570" end="6.730">a</span> <span begin="6.730" end="6.940">sin</span><span begin="6.940" end="7.070">gle</span> <span begin="7.170" end="7.400">se</span><span begin="7.400" end="7.620">cond</span> <span begin="7.620" end="7.810">so</span> <span begin="7.810" end="7.910">you</span> <span begin="8.020" end="8.400">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需短短一秒 便能让你看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只需短短一秒 便能讓你看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ほんの一秒でいい その目で確かめろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">단 1초면 네가 알 수 있을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Juste une seule seconde pour que tu voies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo un segundo para que veas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur eine einzige Sekunde damit du erkennst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só um segundo para você perceber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всего одну секунду чтобы ты увидел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo un secondo perché tu possa vedere</span></p><p begin="8.450" end="11.120" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.450" end="8.640">That,</span> <span begin="8.640" end="8.860">in</span><span begin="8.860" end="9.300">deed,</span> <span begin="9.300" end="9.480">we&apos;ll</span> <span begin="9.480" end="9.690">be</span> <span begin="9.690" end="9.880">lea</span><span begin="9.880" end="10.080">ving</span> <span begin="10.080" end="10.300">you</span> <span begin="10.300" end="10.500">be</span><span begin="10.500" end="11.060">hin</span><span begin="11.060" end="11.120">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终将把你远远甩在身后</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們終將把你遠遠甩在身後</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちがお前を置き去りにしてゆくことを</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 정말 널 뒤에 남겨 두고 떠날 거란 걸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qu’en effet nous allons te laisser derrière nous</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que en efecto vamos a dejarte atrás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass wir dich tatsächlich hinter uns lassen werden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que de fato vamos deixar você para trás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что мы и вправду оставим тебя позади</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che davvero ti lasceremo indietro</span></p><p begin="12.590" end="15.410" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.590" end="12.780">Far</span> <span begin="12.780" end="12.970">a</span><span begin="12.970" end="13.250">cro</span><span begin="13.250" end="13.420">ss</span> <span begin="13.420" end="13.830">that</span> <span begin="13.830" end="15.180">li</span><span begin="15.180" end="15.340">n</span><span begin="15.340" end="15.410">e</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过那道遥远的界线</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越過那道遙遠的界線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの境界線の遥か彼方へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저 경계선을 훨씬 넘어 멀리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Bien au-delà de cette ligne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mucho más allá de esa línea</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weit jenseits dieser Grenze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Muito além daquela linha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Далеко за той чертой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ben oltre quella linea</span></p><p begin="17.140" end="19.360" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.140" end="17.420">Turn</span> <span begin="17.420" end="17.590">it</span> <span begin="17.590" end="17.810">up</span> <span begin="17.810" end="17.990">so</span> <span begin="17.990" end="18.210">you</span> <span begin="18.210" end="18.410">can</span> <span begin="18.410" end="18.650">hear</span> <span begin="18.650" end="18.740">the</span> <span begin="18.830" end="19.260">bell</span><span begin="19.260" end="19.360">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">调高音量 让你听清那钟声</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">調高音量 讓你聽清那鐘聲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">音を上げろ 鐘の響きが届くように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">볼륨을 높여 종소리가 들리도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Monte le son pour entendre les cloches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sube el volumen para que escuches las campanas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dreh lauter auf damit du die Glocken hörst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aumente o volume para poder ouvir os sinos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сделай громче чтобы услышать звон колоколов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alza il volume così potrai sentire le campane</span></p><p begin="19.650" end="20.970" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.650" end="19.880">Cra</span><span begin="19.880" end="20.090">shing</span> <span begin="20.090" end="20.290">through</span> <span begin="20.290" end="20.360">the</span> <span begin="20.480" end="20.930">clou</span><span begin="20.930" end="20.970">ds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冲破云层 轰然回响</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">衝破雲層 轟然迴響</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">雲を突き破り 轟き渡る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구름을 뚫고 거세게 울려 퍼지는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui déchirent les nuages dans un fracas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Retumbando entre las nubes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sie donnernd durch die Wolken brechen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rompendo as nuvens com estrondo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Грохочущий сквозь облака</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Squarciare le nuvole</span></p><p begin="20.970" end="24.260" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.970" end="21.140">A</span><span begin="21.140" end="21.250">cid</span> <span begin="21.340" end="21.770">rain</span> <span begin="21.770" end="22.000">down</span> <span begin="22.000" end="22.150">the</span> <span begin="22.150" end="22.640">drain,</span> <span begin="22.640" end="22.790">we</span> <span begin="22.790" end="22.980">know</span> <span begin="22.980" end="23.400">all</span> <span begin="23.400" end="23.820">too</span> <span begin="23.820" end="24.260">well</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">酸雨倾泻入阴沟 我们再清楚不过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">酸雨傾瀉入陰溝 我們再清楚不過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">酸性雨が溝へ流れ落ちる 俺たちは嫌というほど知っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">산성비가 하수구로 쏟아져 우린 뼈저리게 알지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La pluie acide se déverse à l’égout nous ne le savons que trop bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La lluvia ácida corre por el desagüe lo sabemos demasiado bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Saurer Regen strömt in den Abfluss wir wissen es nur zu gut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A chuva ácida escorre pelo ralo sabemos bem demais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кислотный дождь стекает в канаву мы знаем это слишком хорошо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La pioggia acida si riversa nello scarico lo sappiamo fin troppo bene</span></p><p begin="25.940" end="28.580" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.940" end="26.120">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="26.120" end="26.330">a</span> <span begin="26.330" end="26.730">li</span><span begin="26.730" end="27.120">ving</span> <span begin="27.120" end="28.200">he</span><span begin="28.200" end="28.580">ll</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这简直是人间炼狱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這簡直是人間煉獄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まさしく生き地獄だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이건 살아 있는 지옥이라는 걸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est un véritable enfer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es un infierno en vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist die Hölle auf Erden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É um verdadeiro inferno em vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это настоящий ад наяву</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È un inferno in terra</span></p><p begin="30.490" end="33.630" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.490" end="30.750">Care</span><span begin="30.750" end="30.950">ful</span> <span begin="30.950" end="31.080">wha</span><span begin="31.080" end="31.220">t you</span> <span begin="31.320" end="31.580">say</span> <span begin="31.580" end="31.740">and</span> <span begin="31.740" end="31.940">who</span> <span begin="31.940" end="32.120">you</span> <span begin="32.120" end="32.370">say</span> <span begin="32.370" end="32.560">and</span> <span begin="32.560" end="32.770">who</span> <span begin="32.770" end="32.860">you</span> <span begin="32.970" end="33.190">say</span> <span begin="33.190" end="33.280">it</span> <span begin="33.350" end="33.630">to</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谨言慎语 看清你在对谁说话 对谁说话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">謹言慎語 看清你在對誰說話 對誰說話</span><span ttm:role="x-translati