:26.970" end="1:27.130">na</span> <span begin="1:27.130" end="1:27.640">turn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若这世界还要继续运转 但愿你能有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若這世界還要繼續運轉 但願你能有所改變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">世界が回り続けるなら お前も変われるといいが</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상이 바뀐다면 너도 달라지길 바라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’espère que tu changeras si le monde doit continuer de tourner</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Espero que cambies si el mundo ha de seguir girando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich hoffe du änderst dich wenn sich die Welt weiterdrehen soll</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Espero que você mude se o mundo continuar girando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Надеюсь ты изменишься если мир продолжит вращаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Spero che tu cambi se il mondo continuerà a girare</span></p><p begin="1:29.040" end="1:31.920" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.040" end="1:29.260">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:29.260" end="1:29.480">none</span> <span begin="1:29.480" end="1:29.650">of</span> <span begin="1:29.650" end="1:29.960">my</span> <span begin="1:30.050" end="1:30.380">con</span><span begin="1:30.480" end="1:31.920">cern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过那早已与我无关</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不過那早已與我無關</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まあ 俺の知ったことじゃない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 그건 내 알 바 아니야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ça ne me regarde pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No es asunto mío</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch das ist nicht meine Angelegenheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Isso não me diz respeito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="r